!! Language Server Protocol

The `--lsp` command serves your editor from the running wiki. It completes tiddler titles as you type a link, and marks links whose target does not exist.

It answers from the same wiki as the MCP server, so a tiddler an assistant has just created is a title your editor offers on the next keystroke.

